          ≡ƒÅ¢∩╕Å Sahakar Samriddhi (PACS &amp; Co-ops) ΓÇó {sahakarLeads.length || 39} Leads
        </button>
      </div>

      {/* KPI Stats */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
